The services which are being procured as part of this Procurement are to provide transportation of Household Waste Recycling Centre (HWRC) materials as instructed by the Council. Lincolnshire County Council is the statutory Waste Collection Authority in Lincolnshire. The Council operates eleven Household Waste Recycling Centres in Lincoln, Market Rasen; Gainsborough, Louth, Tattershall, Skegness, Boston, Spalding, Sleaford, Grantham and Bourne.

The Contract is for the transportation of material from the HWRCs to disposal point sites. The Supplier shall tip the material at the disposal site, then transport the empty container to the HWRC or a separate Drop-Off Point.     

This Contract will be Lotted as follows;
Lot 1 - Great Northern Terrace, Lincoln, Market Rasen and Gainsborough;
Lot 2 - Louth , Tattershall and Skegness;
Lot 3 - Boston and Spalding; 
Lot 4 - Sleaford, Grantham and Bourne.
Each lot shall be awarded to one Supplier. Bidders can bid for one, all or any number of lots, however awards will be capped at a maximum of two lots per bidder. 

The Contract is for a duration of 60 months followed by an option to extend of a further twelve months, followed by another option to extend of 12 months. The maximum duration is 84 months.

